+  //! Hades: the pictures that the video player dropped and that its renderer skipped since the
+  //! video began (the "drop" and "skip" of the debug information of the player), for the player
+  //! information. Written by the video thread each time its information is updated.
+  void SetVideoDropSkip(int dropped, int skipped)
+  {
